{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f Buckle up. Boot up. Your waifu's driving the tank.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In My Waifu Is A Tank Girl!, you're not just entering the battlefield \u2014 you're rolling into it inside a steel beast crewed by elite anime girls with big guns, sharper instincts, and way too much energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They\u2019re cute. They\u2019re deadly. And they\u2019ve got beef with the other side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You? You're the commander. Your job: blast everything that moves and make your waifu crew proud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No plot. No mercy. Just pure, chaotic, waifu-fueled tank mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-speed arena battles with anime-girl tank crews</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your side and unleash shell-shocking firepower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavily armed tanks. Minimal logic. Maximum fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute voices, big explosions, and non-stop action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, hard to survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable CG gallery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1172390?t=1744500395","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1172390?t=1744500395","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172390/41b490e095dd86a24a5d8c6a79fdef5c34f8c543/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744500395","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172390/41b490e095dd86a24a5d8c6a79fdef5c34f8c543/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744500395","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sha